{"id":"impresio_n","lemma":"impresión","pos":"noun","rank":1621,"glosses":["impression","print","shock"],"ipa":"/impɾeˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"impresiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-impresi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Te di esa impresión?","en":"Did I give you that impression?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586522"},{"text":"Las primeras impresiones pueden a menudo ser engañosas.","en":"First impressions can often be misleading."},{"text":"Ésa es también mi impresión.","en":"That's my feeling as well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/605051"},{"text":"¿Qué impresión tienes de Tomás?","en":"What's your impression of Tom?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519696"},{"text":"¿Cuál es su impresión, doctor?","en":"What's your impression, doctor?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77996"}]}